{"id":3304,"slug":"3304-caching-voi-redis-trong-nestjs-cachemodule-ttl-strategy-va-cache-invalidation","category":"NestJS","subcategory":"Testing & Production","level":"advanced","question_vi":"Caching với Redis trong NestJS — CacheModule, TTL strategy và cache invalidation?","question_en":"Caching with Redis in NestJS — CacheModule, TTL strategy and cache invalidation?","answer_vi":"**Setup** với `@nestjs/cache-manager` và Redis:\n```typescript\nCacheModule.registerAsync({\n  isGlobal: true,\n  useFactory: async (config: ConfigService) => ({\n    store: await redisStore({ socket: { host: config.get('REDIS_HOST'), port: 6379 } }),\n    ttl: 60 * 1000,  // 60 giây default\n  }),\n  inject: [ConfigService],\n})\n```\n\n**Automatic caching** với interceptor:\n```typescript\n@UseInterceptors(CacheInterceptor)\n@CacheTTL(5 * 60 * 1000)  // cache-manager v5+ tính bằng MILLISECONDS (5 phút)\n@Get('products')\nasync getProducts() { ... }\n```\n\n**Manual caching** (more control):\n```typescript\nconstructor(@Inject(CACHE_MANAGER) private cache: Cache) {}\n\nasync getProduct(id: number) {\n  const cached = await this.cache.get<Product>(`product:${id}`);\n  if (cached) return cached;\n\n  const product = await this.repo.findOne({ where: { id } });\n  await this.cache.set(`product:${id}`, product, 300000);  // cache-manager v5 dùng MILLISECONDS\n  return product;\n}\n\nasync updateProduct(id: number, dto: UpdateProductDto) {\n  const product = await this.repo.save({ id, ...dto });\n  await this.cache.del(`product:${id}`);  // Invalidate\n  return product;\n}\n```\n\nCache-aside pattern: luôn invalidate khi write, set TTL ngắn hơn thực tế cần để tránh stale data quá lâu","answer_en":"**Setup** with `@nestjs/cache-manager` and Redis:\n```typescript\nCacheModule.registerAsync({\n  isGlobal: true,\n  useFactory: async (config: ConfigService) => ({\n    store: await redisStore({ socket: { host: config.get('REDIS_HOST'), port: 6379 } }),\n    ttl: 60 * 1000,  // 60 seconds by default\n  }),\n  inject: [ConfigService],\n})\n```\n\n**Automatic caching** with the interceptor:\n```typescript\n@UseInterceptors(CacheInterceptor)\n@CacheTTL(5 * 60 * 1000)  // cache-manager v5+ counts MILLISECONDS (5 minutes)\n@Get('products')\nasync getProducts() { ... }\n```\n\n**Manual caching** (more control):\n```typescript\nconstructor(@Inject(CACHE_MANAGER) private cache: Cache) {}\n\nasync getProduct(id: number) {\n  const cached = await this.cache.get<Product>(`product:${id}`);\n  if (cached) return cached;\n\n  const product = await this.repo.findOne({ where: { id } });\n  await this.cache.set(`product:${id}`, product, 300000);  // cache-manager v5 takes MILLISECONDS\n  return product;\n}\n\nasync updateProduct(id: number, dto: UpdateProductDto) {\n  const product = await this.repo.save({ id, ...dto });\n  await this.cache.del(`product:${id}`);  // invalidate\n  return product;\n}\n```\n\nCache-aside pattern: always invalidate on write, and set the TTL shorter than you strictly need so stale data cannot linger","answer_html_vi":"<p><strong>Setup</strong> với <code>@nestjs/cache-manager</code> và Redis:</p><div class=\"qa-code-wrap\"><span class=\"qa-code-lang\">typescript</span><button type=\"button\" class=\"qa-code-copy\" data-code=\"CacheModule.registerAsync({\n  isGlobal: true,\n  useFactory: async (config: ConfigService) =&gt; ({\n    store: await redisStore({ socket: { host: config.get('REDIS_HOST'), port: 6379 } }),\n    ttl: 60 * 1000,  // 60 giây default\n  }),\n  inject: [ConfigService],\n})\" aria-label=\"Copy code\"><svg class=\"qa-code-copy-icon-default\" width=\"13\" height=\"13\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><rect x=\"9\" y=\"9\" width=\"13\" height=\"13\" rx=\"2\" ry=\"2\"/><path d=\"M5 15H4a2 2 0 0 1-2-2V4a2 2 0 0 1 2-2h9a2 2 0 0 1 2 2v1\"/></svg><svg class=\"qa-code-copy-icon-done\" width=\"13\" height=\"13\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2.5\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M20 6 9 17l-5-5\"/></svg><span class=\"qa-code-copy-label-default\">Copy</span><span class=\"qa-code-copy-label-done\">Copied</span></button><pre class=\"qa-code-pre\"><code class=\"qa-code-block hljs\"><span class=\"hljs-title class_\">CacheModule</span>.<span class=\"hljs-title function_\">registerAsync</span>({\n  <span class=\"hljs-attr\">isGlobal</span>: <span class=\"hljs-literal\">true</span>,\n  <span class=\"hljs-attr\">useFactory</span>: <span class=\"hljs-title function_\">async</span> (<span class=\"hljs-attr\">config</span>: <span class=\"hljs-title class_\">ConfigService</span>) =&gt; ({\n    <span class=\"hljs-attr\">store</span>: <span class=\"hljs-keyword\">await</span> <span class=\"hljs-title function_\">redisStore</span>({ <span class=\"hljs-attr\">socket</span>: { <span class=\"hljs-attr\">host</span>: config.<span class=\"hljs-title function_\">get</span>(<span class=\"hljs-string\">&#x27;REDIS_HOST&#x27;</span>), <span class=\"hljs-attr\">port</span>: <span class=\"hljs-number\">6379</span> } }),\n    <span class=\"hljs-attr\">ttl</span>: <span class=\"hljs-number\">60</span> * <span class=\"hljs-number\">1000</span>,  <span class=\"hljs-comment\">// 60 giây default</span>\n  }),\n  <span class=\"hljs-attr\">inject</span>: [<span class=\"hljs-title class_\">ConfigService</span>],\n})</code></pre></div><p><strong>Automatic caching</strong> với interceptor:</p><div class=\"qa-code-wrap\"><span class=\"qa-code-lang\">typescript</span><button type=\"button\" class=\"qa-code-copy\" data-code=\"@UseInterceptors(CacheInterceptor)\n@CacheTTL(5 * 60 * 1000)  // cache-manager v5+ tính bằng MILLISECONDS (5 phút)\n@Get('products')\nasync getProducts() { ... }\" aria-label=\"Copy code\"><svg class=\"qa-code-copy-icon-default\" width=\"13\" height=\"13\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentCo